{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10332","headline":"和贺兰判官望北海作 · 高适","name":"和贺兰判官望北海作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣代务平典，輶轩推上才。\n迢遥溟海际，旷望沧波开。\n四牡未遑息，三山安在哉。\n巨鳌不可钓，高浪何崔嵬。\n湛湛朝百谷，茫茫连九垓。\n挹流纳广大，观异增迟廻。\n日出见鱼目，月圆知蚌胎。\n迹非想像到，心以精灵猜。\n远色带孤屿，虚声涵殷雷。\n风行越裳贡，水遏天吴灾。\n揽辔隼将击，忘机鸥复来。\n缘情韵骚雅，独立遗尘埃。\n吏道竟殊用，翰林仍忝陪。\n长鸣谢知己，所媿非龙媒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10332.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10332","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}